<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97808" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύγ-κλεισις</span></b> , old 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύγκλῃσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλείω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shutting up, closing up</i> (of a line of battle),
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.71
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φάλαγγος ἡ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.4.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλείσει κωλύειν τὴν δίοδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>locking up, safe storage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.237.21
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a being closed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχυρὰν . . τὴν ς.
				αὐτῶν πρὸς ἄλληλα κέκτηται</span> has them closely
			locked together, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				81b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ συναφῆς καὶ συγκλείσεως χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Spir.</u>
					484b22
				</span></i>
			; <i>locking</i> of shields in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χελώνη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				11.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλείσεις</span>
			<i>narrow passes, defiles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.44.7
			</span></i>, 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλίσεις</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				41
			</span></i>.</div>
